<p>Sonatype Nexus Repository is the leading JFrog Artifactory alternative. Let Sonatype migrate your artifact repository to the Sonatype cloud to ensure a successful cutover with minimal downtime. It sets you up for future success ensuring a solid and certified foundation on which is built on a trusted repository to power innovation for years to come. Here's how a Sonatype Migration Specialist will move your JFrog artifact repository to Nexus Repository Cloud:</p></div> 
