            <h3 class="h4">Lives up to the hype</h3>
            <p class="top-quote">Repository Manager and Lifecycle are both integrated into our CI/CD pipeline. While Repository Manager is used to pull and deploy packages, Lifecycle is searching for vulnerabilities. Based on the valuable data Sonatype provides us, we are able to make decisions on whether to allow the build to continue...</p>
            
            
            
            <a class="btn btn--link btn--arrow" href="https://www.trustradius.com/reviews/sonatype-platform-2023-12-05-12-53-14" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
